
~ start

if not GameState.was_event_seen("bathroom_first_visit")
	$> GameState.mark_event_seen("bathroom_first_visit")
	PLUM: Okay I'm going to pee! (embarassed)
	VINCENT: Don't take too long. [scene=bathroom]
	=> END

else
	PLUM: I'm going to the bathroom again. (embarassed) [scene=bathroom]
	=> END
